	["In his gratitude, Konmuld gave you one of his old Yalahari set pieces."] = "In his gratitude, Konmuld gave you one of his old Yalahari set pieces.",
	["You finished this mission."] = "You finished this mission.",
	["Mission 5: Radio free Hirschberg"] = "Mission 5: Radio free Hirschberg",
	["Konmuld mentioned to search the Retro Knurow for a lost radio of old."] = "Konmuld mentioned to search the Retro Knurow for a lost radio of old.",
